DatStrToDays: convert datestring 'DD.MM.YY' or 'DD.MM.YYYY' into sum of days
              dividing character is not importent
Input   : string, length 8 or 10
OutPut  : sum of days,
          if inputlength is not 8 or 10 or if month is not between
          1 and 12 , day not between 1 and 31 it returns 0 !!
Version : @(#) KN_TOOLS.PAS V:1.0
